{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"观念"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"基变换"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"基变换"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>基变换是"},{"Local":{"url":"相对","text":"相对观点"}},{"Plain":"在不同基底空间之间的转换.</p>\n<p>几何对象之间的基变换常常是指"},{"Local":{"url":"拉回","text":"拉回"}},{"Plain":". 对于拉回图\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n\t{ccc}\r\n\tX' &amp; \\overset{u'}{\\to} &amp; X \\\\\r\n\t\\!\\!\\!\\!\\!\\! {}^{f'}\\downarrow &amp;&amp; \\downarrow {}^{f} \\!\\!\\!\\!\\! \\\\\r\n\tY' &amp; \\underset{u}{\\to} &amp; Y\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n有自然变换\n$$\r\nu^* f_* \\to f'_* u^{\\prime *},\r\n$$\n称为基变换映射. 在许多条件下这个映射是同构.</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>平坦基变换</h3>\n<p>若 $u$ 为"},{"Local":{"url":"平坦态射","text":"平坦态射"}},{"Plain":", 则基变换映射为同构. 这个事实的一个应用是 "},{"Local":{"url":"Kunneth公式","text":"Kunneth 公式"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\Gamma(E\\boxtimes F)\\simeq \\Gamma E\\otimes \\Gamma F.\r\n$$</p>\n"}]}}